## Core architecture

```
User Intent
    │
    ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Brain Layer                                                 │
│  • brain/router.py  — provider routing + fallback           │
│  • brain/llm.py     — multi-provider streaming chat         │
│  • brain/research.py — deep web research with citations     │
│  • brain/workflow.py — step-based workflow engine           │
│  • brain/builder.py  — full-stack project generator           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Cognitive System                                            │
│  • cognitive/intent.py — intent parsing                       │
│  • cognitive/decomposer.py — goal → subtask DAG               │
│  • cognitive/coordinator.py — parallel execution              │
│  • cognitive/reflector.py — post-run critique                 │
│  • cognitive/ponytail.py — 11-stage coding pipeline           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Execution Layer                                             │
│  • execution/runner.py — Python/Bash/Node runner             │
│  • execution/files.py — project-scoped file I/O              │
│  • execution/script_runner.py — scheduled/manual/webhooks    │
│  • execution/search.py — Tavily/SearXNG web search            │
│  • execution/terminal.py — interactive xterm.js PTY            │
│  • execution/vcs.py — git operations                           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Governance Layer (UCIP)                                     │
│  • governance/ucip.py — policy engine + injection scanner     │
│  • governance/identity_context.py — identity / tokens / tiers │
│  • governance/rbac.py — tier + capability-token access        │
│  • governance/audit.py — immutable audit events               │
│  • governance/evidence.py — execution provenance DAG          │
│  • governance/billing.py — usage metering                     │
│  • governance/marketplace.py — capability store                │
│  • governance/ratelimit.py — rate limiting                     │
│  • governance/hitl.py — human-in-the-loop approvals            │
│  • governance/sandbox.py — resource-limited sandbox            │
│  • governance/secrets_vault.py — encrypted secrets             │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Memory Layer                                                │
│  • memory/store.py — episodic/semantic/long-term recall        │
│  • memory/graph.py — knowledge graph                         │
│  • memory/working.py — TTL session cache                       │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Communications                                              │
│  • communications/bus.py — async pub/sub + SSE                 │
│  • communications/mcp.py — MCP server/client transport         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Workers                                                     │
│  • workers/runtime.py — persona execution wrapper              │
│  • brain/agents/ — 106+ worker personas                      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Key production readiness highlights

- **Dual auth with Supabase-primary + local fallback** ([`api/routes/auth.py`](api/routes/auth.py:1))
- **Encrypted secrets vault** with per-secret salt and PBKDF2 key derivation
  ([`governance/secrets_vault.py`](governance/secrets_vault.py:1))
- **Human-in-the-loop gates** for destructive actions via [`governance/hitl.py`](governance/hitl.py:1)
- **Sandboxed execution** with `resource.prlimit` applied to child PIDs
  ([`governance/sandbox.py`](governance/sandbox.py:243))
- **Immutable audit trail** and EvidenceChain DAG
  ([`governance/audit.py`](governance/audit.py), [`governance/evidence.py`](governance/evidence.py))
- **Project-scoped file I/O** with path-escape prevention
  ([`execution/files.py`](execution/files.py:35))
- **Rate limiting + structured logging** ([`governance/ratelimit.py`](governance/ratelimit.py),
  [`core/config.py`](core/config.py:66))
- **JWT issuer/audience binding** to prevent cross-service replay
  ([`api/routes/auth.py`](api/routes/auth.py:47))

See [`plans/SECURITY_AUDIT.md`](plans/SECURITY_AUDIT.md) for the line-by-line audit
(P5 / P5a–P5e) and [`plans/bug-audit-plan.md`](plans/bug-audit-plan.md) for the
most-recent bug/fix inventory.

---

## Testing

```bash
# Run the full test suite
python3 -m pytest tests/ -v

# Smoke test imports without running a server
python3 -c "import app, cli"
```

Tests cover RBAC, identity context, capability registry, evidence chains, audit,
workflows, and brain routing.

---

## CLI

```bash
python3 cli.py start       # Start the server
python3 cli.py build       # Build the React frontend SPA
python3 cli.py doctor      # System health check
python3 cli.py audit       # View audit log
python3 cli.py billing     # View billing usage
python3 cli.py marketplace # Browse capability marketplace
python3 cli.py workflow    # Manage workflows
python3 cli.py research    # Run deep research
python3 cli.py version     # Show version info
```

---

## API documentation

FastAPI auto-generated docs are available at `/docs` once the server is running:
http://localhost:8000/docs

The frontend expects the API at the same origin (`/api/*`).  CORS origins can be
configured via `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` in `.env`.

