## Project status

DevOS V4 is functionally complete for the core Agency OS feature set.  The remaining
high-value items are tracked in [`PRODUCTION_PLAN.md`](PRODUCTION_PLAN.md):
frontend HITL notifications, live LLM/browser/docker smoke tests (which cannot be
run in this sandboxed environment), and packaging the Tauri desktop app.
